{"n":44,"name":"Ad-Dukhan","nameAr":"الدخان","meaning":"The Smoke","ayahs":59,"place":"makkah","bismillah":true,"ayat":[{"n":1,"juz":25,"ar":"حمٓ","en":"Ḥā, Meem.","w":[{"ar":"حمٓ","tr":"hha-meem","en":"Ha Meem"}]},{"n":2,"juz":25,"ar":"وَٱلْكِتَـٰبِ ٱلْمُبِينِ","en":"By the clear Book,","w":[{"ar":"وَٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","tr":"wal-kitābi","en":"By the Book","root":"كتب","lem":"كِتاب"},{"ar":"ٱلْمُبِينِ","tr":"l-mubīni","en":"the clear","root":"بين","lem":"مُبِين"}]},{"n":3,"juz":25,"ar":"إِنَّآ أَنزَلْنَـٰهُ فِى لَيْلَةٍ مُّبَـٰرَكَةٍ ۚ إِنَّا كُنَّا مُنذِرِينَ","en":"Indeed, We sent it down during a blessed night. Indeed, We were to warn [mankind].","w":[{"ar":"إِنَّآ","tr":"innā","en":"Indeed, We"},{"ar":"أَنزَلْنَـٰهُ","tr":"anzalnāhu","en":"revealed it","root":"نزل","lem":"أَنزَلَ"},{"ar":"فِى","tr":"fī","en":"in"},{"ar":"لَيْلَةٍۢ","tr":"laylatin","en":"a Night","root":"ليل","lem":"لَيْلَة"},{"ar":"مُّبَـٰرَكَةٍ ۚ","tr":"mubārakatin","en":"Blessed","root":"برك","lem":"مُبارَكَة"},{"ar":"إِنَّا","tr":"innā","en":"Indeed, We"},{"ar":"كُنَّا","tr":"kunnā","en":"[We] are","root":"كون","lem":"كانَ"},{"ar":"مُنذِرِينَ","tr":"mundhirīna","en":"(ever) warning","root":"نذر","lem":"مُنذِر"}]},{"n":4,"juz":25,"ar":"فِيهَا يُفْرَقُ كُلُّ أَمْرٍ حَكِيمٍ","en":"Therein [i.e., on that night] is made distinct every precise matter -","w":[{"ar":"فِيهَا","tr":"fīhā","en":"Therein"},{"ar":"يُفْرَقُ","tr":"yuf'raqu","en":"is made distinct","root":"فرق","lem":"فَرَقْ"},{"ar":"كُلُّ","tr":"kullu","en":"every","root":"كلل","lem":"كُلّ"},{"ar":"أَمْرٍ","tr":"amrin","en":"affair","root":"أمر","lem":"أَمْر"},{"ar":"حَكِيمٍ","tr":"ḥakīmin","en":"wise","root":"حكم","lem":"حَكِيم"}]},{"n":5,"juz":25,"ar":"أَمْرًا مِّنْ عِندِنَآ ۚ إِنَّا كُنَّا مُرْسِلِينَ","en":"[Every] matter [proceeding] from Us. Indeed, We were to send [a messenger]","w":[{"ar":"أَمْرًۭا","tr":"amran","en":"A command","root":"أمر","lem":"أَمْر"},{"ar":"مِّنْ","tr":"min","en":"from"},{"ar":"عِندِنَآ ۚ","tr":"ʿindinā","en":"Us","root":"عند","lem":"عِند"},{"ar":"إِنَّا","tr":"innā","en":"Indeed, We"},{"ar":"كُنَّا","tr":"kunnā","en":"[We] are","root":"كون","lem":"كانَ"},{"ar":"مُرْسِلِينَ","tr":"mur'silīna","en":"(ever) sending","root":"رسل","lem":"مُرْسِل"}]},{"n":6,"juz":25,"ar":"رَحْمَةً مِّن رَّبِّكَ ۚ إِنَّهُۥ هُوَ ٱلسَّمِيعُ ٱلْعَلِيمُ","en":"As mercy from your Lord. Indeed, He is the Hearing, the Knowing,","w":[{"ar":"رَحْمَةًۭ","tr":"raḥmatan","en":"As Mercy","root":"رحم","lem":"رَحْمَة"},{"ar":"مِّن","tr":"min","en":"from"},{"ar":"رَّبِّكَ ۚ","tr":"rabbika","en":"your Lord","root":"ربب","lem":"رَبّ"},{"ar":"إِنَّهُۥ","tr":"innahu","en":"Indeed, He"},{"ar":"هُوَ","tr":"huwa","en":"[He]"},{"ar":"ٱلسَّمِيعُ","tr":"l-samīʿu","en":"(is) the All-Hearer","root":"سمع","lem":"سَمِيع"},{"ar":"ٱلْعَلِيمُ","tr":"l-ʿalīmu","en":"the All-Knower","root":"علم","lem":"عَلِيم"}]},{"n":7,"juz":25,"ar":"رَبِّ ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَٱلْأَرْضِ وَمَا بَيْنَهُمَآ ۖ إِن كُنتُم مُّوقِنِينَ","en":"Lord of the heavens and the earth and that between them, if you would be certain.","w":[{"ar":"رَبِّ","tr":"rabbi","en":"Lord","root":"ربب","lem":"رَبّ"},{"ar":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","tr":"l-samāwāti","en":"(of) the heavens","root":"سمو","lem":"سَماء"},{"ar":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ","tr":"wal-arḍi","en":"and the earth","root":"أرض","lem":"أَرْض"},{"ar":"وَمَا","tr":"wamā","en":"and whatever"},{"ar":"بَيْنَهُمَآ ۖ","tr":"baynahumā","en":"(is) between both of them","root":"بين","lem":"بَيْن"},{"ar":"إِن","tr":"in","en":"if"},{"ar":"كُنتُم","tr":"kuntum","en":"you are","root":"كون","lem":"كانَ"},{"ar":"مُّوقِنِينَ","tr":"mūqinīna","en":"certain","root":"يقن","lem":"مُوقِن"}]},{"n":8,"juz":25,"ar":"لَآ إِلَـٰهَ إِلَّا هُوَ يُحْىِۦ وَيُمِيتُ ۖ رَبُّكُمْ وَرَبُّ ءَابَآئِكُمُ ٱلْأَوَّلِينَ","en":"There is no deity except Him; He gives life and causes death. [He is] your Lord and the Lord of your first forefathers.","w":[{"ar":"لَآ","tr":"lā","en":"(There is) no"},{"ar":"إِلَـٰهَ","tr":"ilāha","en":"god","root":"أله","lem":"إِلٰه"},{"ar":"إِلَّا","tr":"illā","en":"except"},{"ar":"هُوَ","tr":"huwa","en":"Him"},{"ar":"يُحْىِۦ","tr":"yuḥ'yī","en":"He gives life","root":"حيي","lem":"أَحْيا"},{"ar":"وَيُمِيتُ ۖ","tr":"wayumītu","en":"and causes death","root":"موت","lem":"أَماتَ"},{"ar":"رَبُّكُمْ","tr":"rabbukum","en":"your Lord","root":"ربب","lem":"رَبّ"},{"ar":"وَرَبُّ","tr":"warabbu","en":"and (the) Lord","root":"ربب","lem":"رَبّ"},{"ar":"ءَابَآئِكُمُ","tr":"ābāikumu","en":"(of) your fathers","root":"أبو","lem":"آباء"},{"ar":"ٱلْأَوَّلِينَ","tr":"l-awalīna","en":"the former","root":"أول","lem":"أَوَّل"}]},{"n":9,"juz":25,"ar":"بَلْ هُمْ فِى شَكٍّ يَلْعَبُونَ","en":"But they are in doubt, amusing themselves.","w":[{"ar":"بَلْ","tr":"bal","en":"Nay"},{"ar":"هُمْ","tr":"hum","en":"they"},{"ar":"فِى","tr":"fī","en":"(are) in"},{"ar":"شَكٍّۢ","tr":"shakkin","en":"doubt ","root":"شكك","lem":"شَكّ"},{"ar":"يَلْعَبُونَ","tr":"yalʿabūna","en":"playing","root":"لعب","lem":"يَلْعَبْ"}]},{"n":10,"juz":25,"ar":"فَٱرْتَقِبْ يَوْمَ تَأْتِى ٱلسَّمَآءُ بِدُخَانٍ مُّبِينٍ","en":"Then watch for the Day when the sky will bring a visible smoke","w":[{"ar":"فَٱرْتَقِبْ","tr":"fa-ir'taqib","en":"Then watch","root":"رقب","lem":"ارْتَقِبْ"},{"ar":"يَوْمَ","tr":"yawma","en":"(for the) Day","root":"يوم","lem":"يَوْم"},{"ar":"تَأْتِى","tr":"tatī","en":"(when) will bring","root":"أتي","lem":"أَتَى"},{"ar":"ٱلسَّمَآءُ","tr":"l-samāu","en":"the sky","root":"سمو","lem":"سَماء"},{"ar":"بِدُخَانٍۢ","tr":"bidukhānin","en":"smoke","root":"دخن","lem":"دُخان"},{"ar":"مُّبِينٍۢ","tr":"mubīnin","en":"visible","root":"بين","lem":"مُبِين"}]},{"n":11,"juz":25,"ar":"يَغْشَى ٱلنَّاسَ ۖ هَـٰذَا عَذَابٌ أَلِيمٌ","en":"Covering the people; this is a painful torment.","w":[{"ar":"يَغْشَى","tr":"yaghshā","en":"Enveloping","root":"غشو","lem":"غَشِيَ"},{"ar":"ٱلنَّاسَ ۖ","tr":"l-nāsa","en":"the people","root":"أنس","lem":"ناس"},{"ar":"هَـٰذَا","tr":"hādhā","en":"This"},{"ar":"عَذَابٌ","tr":"ʿadhābun","en":"(will be) a punishment","root":"عذب","lem":"عَذاب"},{"ar":"أَلِيمٌۭ","tr":"alīmun","en":"painful","root":"ألم","lem":"أَلِيم"}]},{"n":12,"juz":25,"ar":"رَّبَّنَا ٱكْشِفْ عَنَّا ٱلْعَذَابَ إِنَّا مُؤْمِنُونَ","en":"[They will say], \"Our Lord, remove from us the torment; indeed, we are believers.\"","w":[{"ar":"رَّبَّنَا","tr":"rabbanā","en":"Our Lord","root":"ربب","lem":"رَبّ"},{"ar":"ٱكْشِفْ","tr":"ik'shif","en":"Remove","root":"كشف","lem":"كَشَفَ"},{"ar":"عَنَّا","tr":"ʿannā","en":"from us"},{"ar":"ٱلْعَذَابَ","tr":"l-ʿadhāba","en":"the punishment","root":"عذب","lem":"عَذاب"},{"ar":"إِنَّا","tr":"innā","en":"indeed, we"},{"ar":"مُؤْمِنُونَ","tr":"mu'minūna","en":"(are) believers","root":"أمن","lem":"مُؤْمِن"}]},{"n":13,"juz":25,"ar":"أَنَّىٰ لَهُمُ ٱلذِّكْرَىٰ وَقَدْ جَآءَهُمْ رَسُولٌ مُّبِينٌ","en":"How will there be for them a reminder [at that time]? And there had come to them a clear Messenger.","w":[{"ar":"أَنَّىٰ","tr":"annā","en":"How can"},{"ar":"لَهُمُ","tr":"lahumu","en":"(there be) for them"},{"ar":"ٱلذِّكْرَىٰ","tr":"l-dhik'rā","en":"the reminder","root":"ذكر","lem":"ذِكْرَى"},{"ar":"وَقَدْ","tr":"waqad","en":"when verily"},{"ar":"جَآءَهُمْ","tr":"jāahum","en":"had come to them","root":"جيأ","lem":"جاءَ"},{"ar":"رَسُولٌۭ","tr":"rasūlun","en":"a Messenger","root":"رسل","lem":"رَسُول"},{"ar":"مُّبِينٌۭ","tr":"mubīnun","en":"clear","root":"بين","lem":"مُبِين"}]},{"n":14,"juz":25,"ar":"ثُمَّ تَوَلَّوْا۟ عَنْهُ وَقَالُوا۟ مُعَلَّمٌ مَّجْنُونٌ","en":"Then they turned away from him and said, \"[He was] taught [and is] a madman.\"","w":[{"ar":"ثُمَّ","tr":"thumma","en":"Then"},{"ar":"تَوَلَّوْا۟","tr":"tawallaw","en":"they turned away","root":"ولي","lem":"تَوَلَّى"},{"ar":"عَنْهُ","tr":"ʿanhu","en":"from him"},{"ar":"وَقَالُوا۟","tr":"waqālū","en":"and said","root":"قول","lem":"قالَ"},{"ar":"مُعَلَّمٌۭ","tr":"muʿallamun","en":"One taught","root":"علم","lem":"مُعَلَّم"},{"ar":"مَّجْنُونٌ","tr":"majnūnun","en":"a mad man","root":"جنن","lem":"مَجْنُون"}]},{"n":15,"juz":25,"ar":"إِنَّا كَاشِفُوا۟ ٱلْعَ